msgstr "发送的消息从输入框飞到聊天中的位置"

#. Settings > Appearance, description of the "Night" reading theme (font and product names stay as they are)
msgid ""
"A serif in warm parchment tones on brown-black, with little blue. For reading in the dark."
msgstr "棕黑底色上暖羊皮纸色调的衬线字体，蓝光很少。适合在黑暗中阅读。"

