#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (overloaded, rate limited, 429/5xx after the Host's own retries); {backend} is a backend name (Claude, Codex, ...), not translated
#. context: error.provider_busy
msgctxt "error.provider_busy"
msgid ""
"{backend} is overloaded right now, and the Host's retries did not get through. Try again in a minute, or switch model."
msgstr "{backend} 当前负载过高，Host 的重试也未成功。请过一分钟再试，或切换模型。"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the model's provider is unavailable); {model} is a model name, not translated
#. context: error.provider_down
msgctxt "error.provider_down"
msgid ""
"The provider of {model} is unavailable right now. Try again later, or switch model."
msgstr "{model} 的提供商当前不可用。请稍后重试，或切换模型。"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the agent ran on another provider than it is bound to)
#. context: error.provider_mismatch
msgctxt "error.provider_mismatch"
msgid ""
"This agent ran on another model provider than the one it is bound to. Check its Codex home and provider."
msgstr "此智能体运行时使用的模型提供商与其绑定的不一致。请检查它的 Codex 主目录和提供商。"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the model refused (a safety filter blocked the answer))
#. context: error.refused
msgctxt "error.refused"
msgid ""
"The model refused to answer (a safety filter blocked it). Rephrase, or switch model."
msgstr "模型拒绝回答（被安全过滤器拦截）。请换个说法，或切换模型。"

#. chat, failed-turn card, badge for how many times the same failure repeated in a row; keep it short
#. context: error.repeat_count
msgctxt "error.repeat_count"
msgid "{n}×"
msgid_plural "{n}×"
msgstr[0] "{n}×"

#. chat, failed-turn card, note under the buttons after a scheduled retry was accepted; {time} is a time already written in the language ("18:27", "Sat 18:27")
#. context: error.retry_scheduled
msgctxt "error.retry_scheduled"
msgid "Will try again at {time}"
msgstr "将于 {time} 重试"

#. chat, failed-turn card, note under the buttons after the message was sent again
#. context: error.retry_sent
msgctxt "error.retry_sent"
msgid "Sent again"
msgstr "已重新发送"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the backend's process ended unexpectedly); {backend} is a backend name (Claude, Codex, ...), not translated
#. context: error.runner_exit
msgctxt "error.runner_exit"
msgid "{backend} stopped unexpectedly. Try again."
msgstr "{backend} 意外停止。请重试。"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the backend's session is held by another process (a Codex thread with another active writer, a locked Grok session)); {backend} is a backend name (Claude, Codex, ...), not translated
#. context: error.session_locked
msgctxt "error.session_locked"
msgid "The {backend} session is busy in another process. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "{backend} 会话正被另一个进程占用。请稍后重试。"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the backend stopped responding); {backend} is a backend name (Claude, Codex, ...), not translated
#. context: error.timeout
msgctxt "error.timeout"
msgid "{backend} stopped responding. Try again."
msgstr "{backend} 已停止响应。请重试。"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (anything else); {backend} is a backend name (Claude, Codex, ...), not translated
#. context: error.unknown
msgctxt "error.unknown"
msgid ""
"The turn failed at {backend}. Try again, or switch model if it happens again."
msgstr "本轮在 {backend} 处失败。请重试；如果再次出现，请切换模型。"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the account's usage window is spent); {backend} is a backend name (Claude, Codex, ...), not translated
#. context: error.usage_limit
msgctxt "error.usage_limit"
msgid "Your {backend} account is out of usage. Try again later, or switch model."
msgstr "{backend} 账号的用量已用完。请稍后重试，或切换模型。"

#. chat, failed-turn card, the sentence saying why the agent's turn failed (the account's usage window is spent); {backend} is a backend name (Claude, Codex, ...), not translated; {time} is a time already written in the language ("18:27", "Sat 18:27")
#. context: error.usage_limit_until
msgctxt "error.usage_limit_until"
msgid ""
"Your {backend} account is out of usage until {time}. Try again then, or switch model."
msgstr "{backend} 账号的用量已用完，将于 {time} 恢复。届时请重试，或切换模型。"

