#. context: verb
msgctxt "verb"
msgid "Show"
msgstr "显示"

#. Keys (key context “Explorer”): the name of a key's action (verb, an action), in the shortcut bar, Keys help (?) and the key-binding editor. It snoozes the chat until its next message, or wakes it when snoozed.
#. context: verb
msgctxt "verb"
msgid "Snooze"
msgstr "稍后提醒"

#. audio card, key hint label: stops playback (imperative verb)
#. Keys (key context “Chats”): the name of a key's action (verb, an action), in the shortcut bar, Keys help (?) and the key-binding editor. It interrupts what the open agent is doing.
#. Keys (key context “Chat”): the name of a key's action (verb, an action), in the shortcut bar, Keys help (?) and the key-binding editor. It stops the audio clip that is playing
#. Keys (key context “Composer”): the name of a key's action (verb, an action), in the shortcut bar, Keys help (?) and the key-binding editor. It interrupts what the open agent is doing.
#. shortcut bar label: stops the job (imperative verb)
#. context: verb
msgctxt "verb"
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

